# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF on every OS. The evaluation provenance in
# docs/eval_results.md hashes data/seeds/* and the engine sources byte for byte, so a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) would otherwise print other
# input and code hashes than the published commit. Shell scripts and YAML also need LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# binary: never converted
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.hwp binary
*.hwpx binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
